flowchart LR
 Breakfast[Family breakfast and lost-boat memory] --> Cleanup[Cleanup and shared play]
 Cleanup --> Papa[Papa takes Scooby for walk and practice]
 Cleanup --> Rabbit[Rabbit invites PinPin to leaf-boat play]
 Papa --> Garden[Check rescued plant and sniff old garden scrape]
 Rabbit --> Spring[Two leaf boats and two birds at spring]
 Garden --> Clue[Blue edge then tiny bell]
 Clue --> Return[Children hear sound and return by shown path]
 Spring --> Return
 Return --> Boat[Carefully uncover and recognize Papa's boat]
 Boat --> Mud[More digging and muddy roll]
 Mud --> Wait[Practiced wait cue works]
 Wait --> Home[Mama sees muddy dog and objects are put aside]
 Home --> Bath[Checked warm water and voluntary paw-by-paw entry]
 Bath --> Wash[Shampoo brush paws and thorough rinse]
 Wash --> Shake[Pause then huge shake and real reactions]
 Shake --> Dry[Towels and brushing]
 Dry --> Boats[Clean toy and three-boat game]
 Boats --> Farewell[Rabbit leaves with two leaf boats]
 Farewell --> Welcome[Clean dog returns inside at correct scale]
 Welcome --> Rest[Boat memory quiet care yawns and sleep]
